# NOTE: two files below look like config but MUST be committed —
# they are loaded by the browser at runtime, so they are public by
# definition and git cannot make them any less so.
#
#   firebase-config.js  Firebase web config. Firebase web API keys are
#                       designed to be client-visible; access is controlled
#                       by Realtime Database rules, not by hiding the key.
#
#   ! firebase-config.js is NOT ignored — see the security notes in README.md
#                       before adding a Discord webhook URL to it. A webhook
#                       pasted there is readable by anyone and can be used to
#                       spam your Discord channel.Free Assets/Logo/Minecraft GFX.zip
